#: ../../../blog/2025/drop-py27.rst:10
msgid "Letting go of Python 2.7"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2025/drop-py27.rst:12
msgid ""
"About dropping Python 2.7 support in psutil, 3 years ago I stated (:gh:"
"`2014`):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2025/drop-py27.rst:14
msgid ""
"Not a chance, for many years to come. [Python 2.7] currently represents "
"7-10% of total downloads, meaning around 70k / 100k downloads per day."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2025/drop-py27.rst:18
msgid ""
"Only 3 years later, and to my surprise, **downloads for Python 2.7 dropped "
"to 0.36%**! As such, as of psutil 7.0.0, I finally decided to drop support "
"for Python 2.7!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2025/drop-py27.rst:23
msgid "The numbers"
msgstr ""

